<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Southcorp year pre-tax profit flat.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Southcorp year pre-tax profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   189.83 vs 187.05</p>
<p>    Net				    124.22 vs 64.97</p>
